iltin.point3D","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" Transform Scale, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the pop is animated with a spring. At rest a white rounded triangle sits at base","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"scale, centered on the magenta artboard.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_pinchview","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Interaction_PinchView","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_PinchView","title":"Interaction_PinchView","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Interaction_PinchView","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/swami","title":"Swami"}}}